 Route: /dashboard/agents
 Page: List + create/edit voice agent configs
 Data source: GET/POST/PATCH /agents
 ────────────────────────────────────────
 Route: /dashboard/campaigns
 Page: Campaign list, creation wizard
 Data source: GET/POST /campaigns
 ────────────────────────────────────────
 Route: /dashboard/leads
 Page: Lead list, CSV upload, filters
 Data source: GET/POST /leads
 ────────────────────────────────────────
 Route: /dashboard/calls
 Page: Call history, transcript viewer
 Data source: GET /calls
 ────────────────────────────────────────
 Route: /dashboard/wallet
 Page: Balance, transaction history
 Data source: GET /wallet
 ────────────────────────────────────────
 Route: /dashboard/integrations
 Page: Provider status (truthful:
