 New API modules (apps/api/src/)

 - campaigns/ — list, create, update, pause/resume
 - leads/ — list with filters, create, CSV upload
 - call-logs/ — list with filters, transcript fetch
 - wallet/ — balance read, transaction list
 - dashboard/ — overview stats aggregated query

 All use withTenantTransaction + JWT guard + role
 checks.

 New UI components (apps/web/components/)

 - StatCard — for wallet amount, campaign count, etc.
 - DataTable — sortable/filterable table (leads,
 calls, transactions)
 - StatusBadge — campaign/call/lead status chips with
 colors
 - EmptyState — explains how to get started per
 section
 - AgentConfigForm — voice agent settings form with
 live voice preview button (opens browser harness)

