 Milestone 4 — Prepaid Billing (Razorpay)

 Implement after dashboard is working.

 - POST /wallet/topup/order — create Razorpay order,
 store it
 - POST /wallet/topup/webhook — verify Razorpay HMAC
 signature on raw body, credit wallet idempotently
 - BullMQ job: reconcile expired payment orders
 - New migration: 0003_payment_orders.sql

