  - Campaign creation form at /dashboard/campaigns/new

  New database migration — agent_configs table + two
  auth helper SQL functions

  ---
  Steps to activate (do these in order)

  Step 1 — Get Clerk keys (5 minutes)
  1. Go to https://clerk.com → create a free account
  2. Click Create application → name it "India Voice" →
  choose Email as sign-in method
  3. Copy Publishable key (starts pk_test_...) and
  Secret key (starts sk_test_...)

  Step 2 — Add to your .env file
  AUTH_MODE=clerk
  NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_...
  CLERK_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_...

  Step 3 — Apply the new database migration
  npm.cmd run db:migrate
  This creates the agent_configs table and the auth
  helper functions.

  Step 4 — Start everything
  # Window 1 — infrastructure
  npm.cmd run infra:up

  # Window 2 — API + web
  npm.cmd run dev

  Step 5 — Open the browser
  Go to http://localhost:3000 → click Sign in → create
  your account → fill in your business name → you'll
  land on the real dashboard.
